        "TileImage": "$($repository 953aef51-63ed-4a3f-a311-c55a69c20bde).Image",
        "Description": "The sun is a harsh star. You could get sunburn or sun stroke. However, the sun can cause confusion. Confusion allows you to spur out in the heat of the moment. You might fall behind or get too ahead of yourself. A lifeguard on duty may survey the area for anything hazardous. Get your sunscreen on and have fun in the Mumbai sun! :)\r\rThis contract was a made a member of the Hitman Community known as Viv.",
